---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure | 50 Five-Star Hotels"
  description="Transparency about booking links, editorial independence and how 50 Five-Star Hotels handles commercial relationships."
>
  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none
    prose-headings:font-serif prose-headings:text-[#2A2622]
    prose-h1:text-4xl prose-h1:mb-8
    prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:mt-10 prose-h2:mb-4
    prose-p:text-[#2A2622]/75 prose-p:leading-relaxed
    prose-strong:text-[#2A2622]">

    <p class="text-[#A0682E] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest not-prose mb-4">Transparency</p>
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

    <p>
      Some links on 50 Five-Star Hotels are affiliate links. This means that if you click a hotel link and make a booking, I may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
    </p>

    <p>
      The site remains editorial. Hotels are selected because they appear to offer unusually strong value for the quality, location, design, or experience provided. Affiliate relationships do not determine whether a hotel is included.
    </p>

    <p>
      Hotel prices, availability, ratings, and policies can change. Always check the final details directly with the booking provider before making a reservation.
    </p>

    <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
    <p>
      No hotel has paid to be featured here. The scoring, verdicts and written profiles reflect an editorial assessment of each hotel's value case, including its weaknesses and cautions.
    </p>

    <h2>Prices and accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      All price references on this site are approximate and reflect rates observed during research periods. They are not guarantees of current or future availability.
    </p>
    <p>
      Always check the final rate, taxes, room type, location and cancellation policy directly with the booking platform before making any travel decision. Hotel experiences can also vary by room category, season and management changes.
    </p>

    <h2>Five-star designations</h2>
    <p>
      Star ratings are derived from local classification systems, booking platform ratings or hotel self-designations. They are not universally standardised. Some hotels described as five-star here meet international luxury chain standards; others are local or booking-site five-star properties that are interesting for value reasons rather than star-rating equivalence. Each profile explains the relevant category clearly.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this disclosure or notice any inaccuracies, you are welcome to use the contact information on the <a href="/about" class="text-[#A0682E] hover:underline no-underline">about page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
